"""Patina 0.39.0: a stain below every window's sill.

`framing.stain_orders`: a `stain_streak` below every exterior window with a sill, two or more under a wide one, naming
its wall's kind as `wall_material` for Zoo (>= 1.153.0); `openings.EXEMPT` gains `stain_streak`, which hangs inside
its own window's margin by design; `slots.Slot.material` is read.

Proven: tests/test_stains.py and tests/test_openings.py fail on 0.38.1 (fails_on_old.out.txt; the keep-out case also
by hand, 16 orders to 0 on the bank); the clone's suite, 424 passed (suite_clone.out.txt); the slice rebuilt (the
factory's docs/findings/slice_look/, slices 17-17e: 258 orders, 17 on the bank).
"""
